                                "sense_id": "8e19ccd1-3293-3bcb-a2a2-95ddaff4d885",
                                "text": "A small Quantity of Saffron will Tinct more then a very great Quantity of Brasil."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "172a5fe4-586b-3ac1-9df4-ca16d347b973",
                        "entry_id": "4142e62a-4ce3-30d2-b7e8-c0c896378513",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The hard, brown wood of a certain species of the tribe Caesalpinieae; originally sappan (Biancaea sappan), of the East Indies, and later brazilwood, Paubrasilia echinata."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7eb21c63-81af-4978-82a4-ade9c283cbd3",
                                "sense_id": "172a5fe4-586b-3ac1-9df4-ca16d347b973",
                                "text": "The Prouince Brasilia tooke his name of the woode called Brasill."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "841bd6c8-729a-4992-b549-a5cd9506df6a",
                                "sense_id": "172a5fe4-586b-3ac1-9df4-ca16d347b973",
                                "text": "Thou know'st my brittle temper's prone to break.\nAre my bones brazil or my flesh of oak?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be36be20-d9e0-4284-a302-2e25f7ca75c3",
                                "sense_id": "172a5fe4-586b-3ac1-9df4-ca16d347b973",
                                "text": "[P]ernambucco – the finest brasil from Brazil, so strong it almost resembles iron – became the favoured material for good bows."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8e1de366-3ea6-3b43-b5d6-9983bafc25a9",
